# Google C++ Style Guide, strictly.
# https://google.github.io/styleguide/cppguide.html
#
# Adopted before the first release, while reformatting is cheap. Key points
# this enforces: 2-space indentation, 80-column limit, attached braces,
# and Google's #include ordering.
#
# Run over the tree with:
#   find src include tests examples -name '*.cpp' -o -name '*.h' | xargs clang-format -i
---
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: Google
